    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweeda aba badayda haleanjeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida inyas gwajagwat heeyda ghana gisilleanda, ak gwanuus ghana ghwashaayda, gaygawalu heew muut, aba heawagi, ea gisil ang'wan aba gisilleanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas geang'waay siida nea gwajagwadiischi, ak geabwar ea ghami, abeeda ea maygwanda waldeayda foojeanda aba badaydaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea inyas geenuus nea askweari gil abeeda siidida nuusiin ea niidiiy aba giihiideayda foojeanda; siida jagwadiischi gammiisa gideaba gaygawalu haleanjeedida jagwadiin, ama mandeawana gajeeshaayda niny aba waldeayda haleanjeedida jagwadiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidida jagwat siidideanjiin iisinyasa geatingaaschi nea majeek ii heeyda gil ghanea digeeda ghanea gisilleanda gil, abeeda gayghoadaw siida bea haleanjeeda gajeawala duu iyeenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida iyahaak dugwa madamnyeanda siida ghana gwasiksa deadaanyi gwaneayi ak ghwaak madamnyeamba sih nuut, gayghawaldaawa madamnyeandaanyi miy was madamnyeandaanyi bea sabiibu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida iighwarda hilooga ak ghwaak beasta nganooyda siida siimughuush, ea gea miyealach duu ghamiinaada, ghana ghwaak madamnyeanda sean beasta abeeda siida ayeat beasta gayghawalda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida iyadaw giischeewoocheandaanyi lapiya ghana haleanjeeda goodiiw, ak iidu geejagwat aba gheedeaba siisi, ak iidu geanyas siida jagwat, gayghawalda nibiyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimeanyasa siida jagwadiischi, abeeda gaygawa siida bea gheeda madeeda ASEETA ak ghoahiimda geaw gideaba niibuuta ghana ea ii mii ghoabuuta geadi jeeda haleanjeeda giischeewoocheandaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gilinyoo gwasheang'nyeesa siida ea niirja ii heeyda gil, ghana digeeda ghana gisilleanda, ghana ea hang'weaka, ghana giliwas sean roat ak gaba siisi ayi ‘Nih deanyu,’ ng'asheesu bea fiisu asiyeenyean gajeayaat madeeda ASEETA, ak siida jea goorgweaksa ASEETA, gayghawalda nibiyeenya aba heeda giischeewoocheandaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida inyas ghoadaw giischeewoocheandaanyi digeeda, ghana heeyda ghana gisilleanda ghana haleanjeeda was sean goodiiw, ak iidu ghami ghana gagiishachi, ghana ghoareat nea manda siisi daah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak fiisu asiyeenyean gayghwaak habeawooda aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA, siidida ghayi adiiw haleanjeeda iimiighoabuuta geadi gwajagwat haleanjeeda giischeewoocheandaanyi, ak ghamwas siida bea haleanjeeda habeawooni, abeeda siida ea mayghawalda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iisijagwat aba headaanyi, abeeda gayghawalda ak ghoadaw siida bea haleanjeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama iiyaak diyeanga jarooda, gaygweadu gheaptanga goohiimsa siida bea haleanjeeda, abeeda ea mayghawalda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida inyas ghoalaach deeda siida ak gagiishachi ghana ghami, nea seabwa ea manda hiji, abeeda gayghawalda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea seabwa iimida hiji abeeda siida ea mayghawalda, ii deeda ghayi sigadiyeata, ghayi siitayda aba gidageatinda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Deaweedeeda hidaat aba giibinda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida iighurghur huda miyeasat ak ea miyeenyeari ak gwaluudayi, gayghoadayda deeda geajalda, ak ghaghi ghoah gatmoadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ama heawa ghwaan ghoadayda hudaanyi abeeda gayghoadayda lapiyeeda miisa deeda geajalda siitayda aba huda miyeasat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Adisiksi gatmooda was beeneetkweanda goobiida badayda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida wassean luudayi diyeayda gajeenuus.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
