          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iyalaachi lapiyeadaang'u siida bwarbwar, aba jeeda fugeasu indeawi, adiwuurjeewi siida siileakshacheewa ak ea adigasayi gooheaneey gea jih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igeandi gidamida raduutka bea gischeewoocheandaang'u abeeda giideelsi seabwa nea miigamikta aseeta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba nih eaghwadaanyi ghusi, jea gookwa abeeda gaygookwa naaha? Abeeda inyas gooyeawusean gaydealeeysiit aba gideaba aniini geandeawi baydeayda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
