              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gajawoosa fugeasu ghaydidi, ak ea adoayaaji banyeega diyeayda wassean bwar diyeayda jarooda, ajaksiina gudajeega.",
          "type": "text",
